data: {"level":2,"reviewed":{"level":2,"label":"formula / approach","text":"For each group, `scale = absmax / 127`, and a group whose absmax is zero uses scale 1.0. Codes are\n`round_half_to_even(x / scale)`, clipped to [-127, 127]. Dequantization multiplies back. Per-channel\nmeans the absmax runs over every axis except the channel axis, so the scale keeps that axis."},"hints_note":null}

